  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoder with singleprofile setting, establishing a baseline for unimodal RNA representation. Validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639 suggest moderate performance, though no direct comparison to multimodal approaches exists. The impact of alternative encoders or fusion strategies remains uncertain without additional experimental evidence."
}

